# Issue #787's host-crash repro, EXECUTED. A Heritage short alias in REPORTER position whose
# canonical is a user procedure. `execute()` runs `parse()` only and never `check()`, so this path
# is the runtime's alone. `define forward` takes a built-in name, so phase-1 registration raises
# `ol-reserved-word` and nothing runs.
define forward
  return 55
end
print fd
